# Approval

- **GUI** Run batch into Output (+ optional DTF Queues PNG copy): do not run against live data unless the supervisor already said **yes / do it / fill / run**. Confirm folders when unclear.
- **SharedInbox Design Queues watcher** (`design_queues_watcher`): **no approval** by design. Uses folders from `queue_app_settings.json`. Re-runs overwrite PNGs (`P50.png` / `P50_Part N.png`).
